{"4475020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dream Hackers VR", "steam_appid": 4475020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Dream Hackers team and dive into collective dreams, battle ancient nightmares, and uncover the truth hidden at the edge of consciousness. Every run is a new descent into the unknown. No dream is ever the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌌 <strong>INFILTRATE SURREAL COLLECTIVE DREAMS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the Dream Machine to explore unpredictable layers of the dreamworld, from ancient cities and machine-era metropolises to mystic deserts and swamps, through the darkest depths of the Abyss and beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475020/extras/1144c4b6a6b7f0cf13038144d03ba787.poster.avif?t=1786540525\" width=1170 height=460 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475020/extras/1144c4b6a6b7f0cf13038144d03ba787.webm?t=1786540525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475020/extras/1144c4b6a6b7f0cf13038144d03ba787.mp4?t=1786540525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔥 <strong>BATTLE ESCALATING WAVES OF NIGHTMARES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Living nightmares sense your presence with every step you take. The deeper you go, the more powerful and cruel they become. Shoot, dodge, and eliminate enemies and their ancient bosses before they eliminate you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475020/extras/383eea2682d089dacf1477179e8f7cfa.poster.avif?t=1786540525\" width=1170 height=460 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475020/extras/383eea2682d089dacf1477179e8f7cfa.webm?t=1786540525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475020/extras/383eea2682d089dacf1477179e8f7cfa.mp4?t=1786540525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧠 <strong>FORGE YOUR BUILD, SHAPE YOUR TACTICS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine weapons, artifacts, and potions into a strategic arsenal. And remember: every choice you make shapes your chances of survival in the dreamworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475020/extras/a0d0630561b3145d1e1767cab764bfee.poster.avif?t=1786540525\" width=1170 height=460 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475020/extras/a0d0630561b3145d1e1767cab764bfee.webm?t=1786540525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475020/extras/a0d0630561b3145d1e1767cab764bfee.mp4?t=1786540525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🗝️<strong> HUNT FOR SECRETS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every layer of the dreamworld hides mirages and cryptic puzzles. Discover what they conceal, but beware: what lies inside could save you, or put an end to your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475020/extras/6e87eb403179ac6c6513e118f8189c8d.poster.avif?t=1786540525\" width=1170 height=460 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475020/extras/6e87eb403179ac6c6513e118f8189c8d.webm?t=1786540525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475020/extras/6e87eb403179ac6c6513e118f8189c8d.mp4?t=1786540525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Dream Hackers team and dive into collective dreams, battle ancient nightmares, and uncover the truth hidden at the edge of consciousness. Every run is a new descent into the unknown. No dream is ever the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌌 <strong>INFILTRATE SURREAL COLLECTIVE DREAMS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the Dream Machine to explore unpredictable layers of the dreamworld, from ancient cities and machine-era metropolises to mystic deserts and swamps, through the darkest depths of the Abyss and beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475020/extras/1144c4b6a6b7f0cf13038144d03ba787.poster.avif?t=1786540525\" width=1170 height=460 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475020/extras/1144c4b6a6b7f0cf13038144d03ba787.webm?t=1786540525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475020/extras/1144c4b6a6b7f0cf13038144d03ba787.mp4?t=1786540525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔥 <strong>BATTLE ESCALATING WAVES OF NIGHTMARES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Living nightmares sense your presence with every step you take. The deeper you go, the more powerful and cruel they become. Shoot, dodge, and eliminate enemies and their ancient bosses before they eliminate you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475020/extras/383eea2682d089dacf1477179e8f7cfa.poster.avif?t=1786540525\" width=1170 height=460 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475020/extras/383eea2682d089dacf1477179e8f7cfa.webm?t=1786540525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475020/extras/383eea2682d089dacf1477179e8f7cfa.mp4?t=1786540525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧠 <strong>FORGE YOUR BUILD, SHAPE YOUR TACTICS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine weapons, artifacts, and potions into a strategic arsenal. And remember: every choice you make shapes your chances of survival in the dreamworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475020/extras/a0d0630561b3145d1e1767cab764bfee.poster.avif?t=1786540525\" width=1170 height=460 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475020/extras/a0d0630561b3145d1e1767cab764bfee.webm?t=1786540525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475020/extras/a0d0630561b3145d1e1767cab764bfee.mp4?t=1786540525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🗝️<strong> HUNT FOR SECRETS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every layer of the dreamworld hides mirages and cryptic puzzles. Discover what they conceal, but beware: what lies inside could save you, or put an end to your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475020/extras/6e87eb403179ac6c6513e118f8189c8d.poster.avif?t=1786540525\" width=1170 height=460 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475020/extras/6e87eb403179ac6c6513e118f8189c8d.webm?t=1786540525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475020/extras/6e87eb403179ac6c6513e118f8189c8d.mp4?t=1786540525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Join Dream Hackers team in this VR action-adventure roguelike. Infiltrate surreal collective dreams, where danger and discovery intertwine. Create your own builds from various weapons and artifacts to battle living nightmares, defeat their ancient bosses, and uncover the truth of the dreamworld.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Arabic<strong>*</strong>, Bulgarian<strong>*</strong>, Czech<strong>*</strong>, Dutch<strong>*</strong>, Greek<strong>*</strong>, Hungarian<strong>*</strong>, Indonesian<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Polish<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Portugal<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Swedish<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Turkish<strong>*</strong>, Ukrainian<strong>*</strong>, Hebrew, Hindi<strong>*</strong>, Latvian, Lithuanian, Slovak<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475020/62c959ce00206576533f5b0877d69af542300f6b/header.jpg?t=1786540525", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475020/3f99278ff7e4c77bfb06bc94bddc45f135b390de/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786540525", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475020/3f99278ff7e4c77bfb06bc94bddc45f135b390de/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786540525", "website": "https://dreamhackers-vr.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i7-9700 / Ryzen 3700X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1080 8 GB / AMD Radeon RX 5700 XT 8 GB or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 65 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> Meta Quest 2, Quest 3, Quest 3S, Quest Pro Oculus Rift, Rift S Valve Index HTC Vive, Vive Pro, Vive Pro 2, Vive Cosmos, Vive Focus 3, Vive XR Elite Pico Neo 3, Pico 4, Pico 4 Ultra</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i7-13700 / Ryzen 7900X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 24 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 12 GB / AMD Radeon RX 7800 XT 16 GB or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 65 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> Meta Quest 2, Quest 3, Quest 3S, Quest Pro Oculus Rift, Rift S Valve Index HTC Vive, Vive Pro, Vive Pro 2, Vive Cosmos, Vive Focus 3, Vive XR Elite Pico Neo 3, Pico 4, Pico 4 Ultra<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD ⚠️Recommended Setups: ● Best (Paid): Virtual Desktop + VDXR ● Best (Free): SteamVR + Steam Link ● Not recommended, but functional: 1)Meta Horizon Link 2)SteamVR + Virtual Desktop ● Avoid: Steam VR + Meta Horizon Link</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "legal_notice": "© 20